rces> </patcit></patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AMANO MASAYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA SEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TABATA ATSUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGA YUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TOYOTA MOTOR CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AMANO, MASAYA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA, SEIJI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TABATA, ATSUSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGA, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOYOTA JIDOSHA KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>AMANO MASAYA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA SEIJI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TABATA ATSUSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAGA YUTAKA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AMANO, MASAYA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAMURA, SEIJI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TABATA, ATSUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAGA, YUTAKA</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A vehicle capable of easily controlling a deceleration at braking with a motor torque, wherein a vehicle power system comprises, as an example, an engine (10), a motor (20), a torque converter (30), a transmission (100), and an axle (17), all of which are coupled in series, the transmission being a mechanism capable of changing a transmitted torque by switching a gear ratio by controlling a control unit (70).  An operator can indicate the deceleration by a power source brake by operating a shift lever located inside a cabin, the control unit sets, referring to a specified map, a combination of the motor torque and gear ratio so that an indicated deceleration can be achieved and, at braking, the deceleration is corrected according to a depressed amount at a part equivalent to an accelerator pedal play.  Accordingly, the deceleration by the power source brake can be fine-controlled easily.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un véhicule capable de commander facilement une décélération lors du freinage par un couple moteur. Le système moteur du véhicule comporte par exemple un mécanisme (10), un moteur (20), un convertisseur de couple (30), une transmission (100) et un essieu (17), tous ces éléments étant couplés en série, et la transmission étant un mécanisme capable de modifier un couple transmis en modifiant un rapport de démultiplication au moyen d'une unité de commande (70). Un opérateur peut indiquer la décélération mise en oeuvre par un frein assisté par servofrein en actionnant une manette située à l'intérieur de la cabine, les paramètres de l'unité de commande par rapport à une carte spécifiée, une combinaison du couple moteur et du rapport de démultiplication pour atteindre, lors du freinage, une décélération indiquée, la décélération étant corrigée en fonction d'une force appliquée à un organe équivalant à une pédale d'accélérateur. Par conséquent, la décélération au moyen du frein assisté par servofrein peut être facilement commandée de manière précise.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>